  "description": "The cast of docs/scenarios/by-module/apx-ui-launch: Lakeside Garage, whose PARCS vendor Gatewise has no lostTicket through APX yet but runs a good lane console of its own at ui.gatewise.example. The host is the call-center console; the vendor screen records what the agent did under its own client. Launches ea…0a03 (signed token, opened), ea…0a05 (never opened, expired) and ea…0a08 (closed, a vend the lane controller refused) are already on file; the transient with ticket T-61099 and the lost-ticket fee on the standard deck are what UIL-01 turns on.",
